{"seq":2,"slug":"android-deep-linking-implementation","title":"Android 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/android-deep-linking-implementation","wordCount":712,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"android-深链实现\">Android 深链实现</h1><p>Android 深链通过 Intent 系统传递，Activity 通过声明 Intent Filter 来注册对特定 URL 模式的处理能力。随着 Jetpack Navigation 和 Compose 的普及，深链的声明和处理方式更加统一，但底层的 Intent 机制始终存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Intent Filter</strong>：Activity 在 AndroidManifest.xml 中声明能处理的 URL 模式，<code>ACTION_VIEW</code> + <code>BROWSABLE</code> + <code>DEFAULT</code> 三者缺一不可，系统据此路由深链</li>\n<li><strong><code>onNewIntent</code> 陷阱</strong>：<code>singleTask</code> 模式下 App 已在栈中时收到深链不触发 <code>onCreate</code>，只触发 <code>onNewIntent</code>，必须重写此方法否则 App 在前台时深链失效</li>\n<li><strong>Navigation Component</strong>：通过 <code>&lt;deepLink app:uri=&quot;...&quot;&gt;</code> 将 URI 模式声明内嵌到导航图，框架自动处理 Intent 到 destination 的映射和参数提取</li>\n<li><strong>Compose NavHost</strong>：<code>deepLinks = listOf(navDeepLink { uriPattern = &quot;...&quot; })</code> 在路由定义中内联声明，与视图系统的导航图完全等价</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"android-intent-与深链\">Android Intent 与深链</h2><p>当用户点击深链时，Android 系统创建一个带有 <code>Intent.ACTION_VIEW</code> 和目标 URL 的 Intent，并通过 Intent Filter 匹配找到处理它的 Activity：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[深链 URL] --&gt; B[系统创建 Intent]&#10;    B --&gt; C{Intent Filter 匹配}&#10;    C --&gt;|唯一匹配| D[直接打开目标 Activity]&#10;    C --&gt;|多个匹配| E[弹出 App 选择器]&#10;    C --&gt;|无匹配| F[App 未安装时,打开浏览器]\">graph LR\n    A[深链 URL] --&gt; B[系统创建 Intent]\n    B --&gt; C{Intent Filter 匹配}\n    C --&gt;|唯一匹配| D[直接打开目标 Activity]\n    C --&gt;|多个匹配| E[弹出 App 选择器]\n    C --&gt;|无匹配| F[App 未安装时,打开浏览器]</pre><h2 id=\"androidmanifest-xml-intent-filter-声明\">AndroidManifest.xml Intent Filter 声明</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;activity&#10;    android:name=&quot;.MainActivity&quot;&#10;    android:launchMode=&quot;singleTask&quot;&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;!-- 标准入口 --&gt;&#10;    &lt;intent-filter&gt;&#10;        &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.intent.action.MAIN&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.LAUNCHER&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;!-- 自定义 URI Scheme 深链 --&gt;&#10;    &lt;intent-filter&gt;&#10;        &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.intent.action.VIEW&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.DEFAULT&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.BROWSABLE&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;data android:scheme=&quot;myapp&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;!-- Android App Links（HTTPS 深链，需要 autoVerify） --&gt;&#10;    &lt;intent-filter android:autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.intent.action.VIEW&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.DEFAULT&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.BROWSABLE&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;data&#10;            android:scheme=&quot;https&quot;&#10;            android:host=&quot;example.com&quot;&#10;            android:pathPattern=&quot;/product/.*&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;data&#10;            android:scheme=&quot;https&quot;&#10;            android:host=&quot;www.example.com&quot;&#10;            android:pathPattern=&quot;/product/.*&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/activity&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".MainActivity\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:launchMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"singleTask\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- 标准入口 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.action.MAIN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.LAUNCHER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- 自定义 URI Scheme 深链 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.action.VIEW\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.DEFAULT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.BROWSABLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"myapp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- Android App Links（HTTPS 深链，需要 autoVerify） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:autoVerify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.action.VIEW\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.DEFAULT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.BROWSABLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:pathPattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product/.*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"www.example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:pathPattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product/.*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>android:launchMode=&quot;singleTask&quot;</code> 确保深链不会在任务栈中创建额外的 Activity 实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"activity-中处理深链-intent\">Activity 中处理深链 Intent</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {&#10;&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;        setContentView(R.layout.activity_main)&#10;&#10;        // 冷启动时处理深链&#10;        handleIntent(intent)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun onNewIntent(intent: Intent) {&#10;        super.onNewIntent(intent)&#10;        // App 已在栈中时处理新的深链&#10;        setIntent(intent)&#10;        handleIntent(intent)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun handleIntent(intent: Intent) {&#10;        if (intent.action != Intent.ACTION_VIEW) return&#10;&#10;        val uri = intent.data ?: return&#10;        DeepLinkRouter.handle(this, uri)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setContentView(R.layout.activity_main)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 冷启动时处理深链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handleIntent(intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onNewIntent(intent: Intent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onNewIntent(intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // App 已在栈中时处理新的深链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setIntent(intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handleIntent(intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun handleIntent(intent: Intent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (intent.action != Intent.ACTION_VIEW) return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val uri = intent.data ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        DeepLinkRouter.handle(this, uri)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>onNewIntent</code> 是容易遗漏的陷阱：当 Activity 以 <code>singleTask</code> 模式运行时，App 已在前台时收到新深链不会触发 <code>onCreate</code>，只触发 <code>onNewIntent</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jetpack-navigation-component-深链\">Jetpack Navigation Component 深链</h2><p>Jetpack Navigation 提供了声明式的深链配置，将 URI 模式直接绑定到导航图中的 destination：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- res/navigation/main_nav_graph.xml --&gt;&#10;&lt;navigation xmlns:android=&quot;http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android&quot;&#10;    xmlns:app=&quot;http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto&quot;&#10;    app:startDestination=&quot;@id/homeFragment&quot;&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;fragment&#10;        android:id=&quot;@+id/productDetailFragment&quot;&#10;        android:name=&quot;.ui.ProductDetailFragment&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;deepLink&#10;            android:id=&quot;@+id/deepLinkToProduct&quot;&#10;            app:uri=&quot;https://example.com/product/{productId}&quot;&#10;            app:action=&quot;android.intent.action.VIEW&quot;&#10;            app:mimeType=&quot;*/*&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;argument&#10;            android:name=&quot;productId&quot;&#10;            app:argType=&quot;string&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/fragment&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;fragment&#10;        android:id=&quot;@+id/userProfileFragment&quot;&#10;        android:name=&quot;.ui.UserProfileFragment&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;deepLink app:uri=&quot;myapp://user/{userId}&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;argument android:name=&quot;userId&quot; app:argType=&quot;string&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/fragment&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/navigation&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- res/navigation/main_nav_graph.xml --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">navigation</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xmlns:android</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    xmlns:app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    app:startDestination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@id/homeFragment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fragment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        android:id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@+id/productDetailFragment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".ui.ProductDetailFragment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">deepLink</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@+id/deepLinkToProduct\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            app:uri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com/product/{productId}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            app:action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.action.VIEW\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            app:mimeType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">argument</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"productId\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            app:argType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fragment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fragment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        android:id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@+id/userProfileFragment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".ui.UserProfileFragment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">deepLink</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> app:uri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"myapp://user/{userId}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">argument</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"userId\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> app:argType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fragment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">navigation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 在 Activity 中处理 Navigation deep link&#10;class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {&#10;    private lateinit var navController: NavController&#10;&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;        val navHostFragment = supportFragmentManager&#10;            .findFragmentById(R.id.nav_host_fragment) as NavHostFragment&#10;        navController = navHostFragment.navController&#10;&#10;        // Navigation Component 自动处理深链&#10;        val navInflater = navController.navInflater&#10;        val graph = navInflater.inflate(R.navigation.main_nav_graph)&#10;        navController.handleDeepLink(intent)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun onNewIntent(intent: Intent) {&#10;        super.onNewIntent(intent)&#10;        navController.handleDeepLink(intent)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 Activity 中处理 Navigation deep link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var navController: NavController</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val navHostFragment = supportFragmentManager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .findFragmentById(R.id.nav_host_fragment) as NavHostFragment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController = navHostFragment.navController</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Navigation Component 自动处理深链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val navInflater = navController.navInflater</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val graph = navInflater.inflate(R.navigation.main_nav_graph)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController.handleDeepLink(intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onNewIntent(intent: Intent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onNewIntent(intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController.handleDeepLink(intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Navigation Component 会自动从 Intent 中提取 URI，匹配导航图中的 <code>deepLink</code> 声明，并传递路径参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jetpack-compose-navhost-深链\">Jetpack Compose NavHost 深链</h2><p>Compose 的导航使用 <code>NavHost</code> 和 <code>composable</code> DSL，深链声明内联在路由定义中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun AppNavHost(navController: NavHostController) {&#10;    NavHost(&#10;        navController = navController,&#10;        startDestination = &quot;home&quot;&#10;    ) {&#10;        composable(&quot;home&quot;) { HomeScreen(navController) }&#10;&#10;        composable(&#10;            route = &quot;product/{productId}&quot;,&#10;            arguments = listOf(navArgument(&quot;productId&quot;) { type = NavType.StringType }),&#10;            deepLinks = listOf(&#10;                navDeepLink { uriPattern = &quot;https://example.com/product/{productId}&quot; },&#10;                navDeepLink { uriPattern = &quot;myapp://product/{productId}&quot; }&#10;            )&#10;        ) { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val productId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(&quot;productId&quot;)&#10;            ProductDetailScreen(productId = productId ?: &quot;&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composable(&#10;            route = &quot;user/{userId}&quot;,&#10;            deepLinks = listOf(&#10;                navDeepLink { uriPattern = &quot;myapp://user/{userId}&quot; }&#10;            )&#10;        ) { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val userId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(&quot;userId&quot;)&#10;            UserProfileScreen(userId = userId ?: &quot;&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppNavHost(navController: NavHostController) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NavHost(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController = navController,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startDestination = \"home\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(\"home\") { HomeScreen(navController) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            route = \"product/{productId}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arguments = listOf(navArgument(\"productId\") { type = NavType.StringType }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            deepLinks = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navDeepLink { uriPattern = \"https://example.com/product/{productId}\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navDeepLink { uriPattern = \"myapp://product/{productId}\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val productId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(\"productId\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductDetailScreen(productId = productId ?: \"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            route = \"user/{userId}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            deepLinks = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navDeepLink { uriPattern = \"myapp://user/{userId}\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val userId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(\"userId\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            UserProfileScreen(userId = userId ?: \"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Activity 中连接 Intent 和 Compose NavHost：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;        setContent {&#10;            val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;            AppNavHost(navController = navController)&#10;            // Compose NavHost 会自动处理 Intent 深链&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppNavHost(navController = navController)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // Compose NavHost 会自动处理 Intent 深链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"任务栈-back-stack-管理\">任务栈（Back Stack）管理</h2><p>深链打开时的任务栈行为直接影响用户按返回键的体验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>默认行为</th>\n<th>推荐做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从外部打开产品详情</td>\n<td>直接进入详情，返回退出 App</td>\n<td>构造完整栈：首页 → 产品列表 → 产品详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从推送打开订单</td>\n<td>直接进入订单，返回退出 App</td>\n<td>首页 → 订单列表 → 订单详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App 已在前台</td>\n<td>叠加新页面</td>\n<td>根据业务判断是否复用或新建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>使用 Navigation Component 可以用 <code>TaskStackBuilder</code> 构造预期的返回栈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val pendingIntent = TaskStackBuilder.create(context).run {&#10;    addNextIntentWithParentStack(&#10;        Intent(context, ProductDetailActivity::class.java).apply {&#10;            putExtra(&quot;productId&quot;, productId)&#10;        }&#10;    )&#10;    getPendingIntent(0, PendingIntent.FLAG_UPDATE_CURRENT or PendingIntent.FLAG_IMMUTABLE)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val pendingIntent = TaskStackBuilder.create(context).run {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addNextIntentWithParentStack(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Intent(context, ProductDetailActivity::class.java).apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            putExtra(\"productId\", productId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    getPendingIntent(0, PendingIntent.FLAG_UPDATE_CURRENT or PendingIntent.FLAG_IMMUTABLE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"验证-app-links-的调试命令\">验证 App Links 的调试命令</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 检查 App Links 验证状态&#10;adb shell pm get-app-links --user 0 com.example.app&#10;&#10;# 手动重新验证&#10;adb shell pm set-app-links-allowed --user 0 com.example.app true&#10;&#10;# 模拟深链点击&#10;adb shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW \\&#10;    -d &quot;https://example.com/product/123&quot; com.example.app&#10;&#10;# 查看 Intent Filter 匹配结果&#10;adb shell pm query-activities \\&#10;    -a android.intent.action.VIEW \\&#10;    -d &quot;https://example.com/product/123&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查 App Links 验证状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">adb</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shell</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get-app-links</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --user</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> com.example.app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动重新验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">adb</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shell</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set-app-links-allowed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --user</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> com.example.app</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模拟深链点击</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">adb</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shell</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> am</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> android.intent.action.VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://example.com/product/123\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> com.example.app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 Intent Filter 匹配结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">adb</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shell</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> query-activities</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    -a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> android.intent.action.VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://example.com/product/123\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Android 深链实现的核心检查点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三元素缺一不可</strong>：Intent Filter 必须同时声明 <code>ACTION_VIEW</code>、<code>CATEGORY_DEFAULT</code> 和 <code>CATEGORY_BROWSABLE</code>，缺少任一导致深链不触发</li>\n<li><strong><code>onNewIntent</code> 必须实现</strong>：使用 <code>singleTask</code> 或 <code>singleTop</code> Launch Mode 时，App 前台时收到深链只走 <code>onNewIntent</code>，是最常见的遗漏点</li>\n<li><strong>adb 调试优先</strong>：使用 <code>adb shell am start -d &quot;url&quot;</code> 快速验证深链路由，比反复打包测试效率高得多</li>\n<li><strong>Navigation 优先于手动路由</strong>：Jetpack Navigation Component 和 Compose NavHost 的声明式深链比手动 Intent 解析更安全、更易维护</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"ios-deep-linking-implementation\">iOS 深链实现</a> 覆盖 iOS 侧的 SceneDelegate 和 SwiftUI 处理；<a href=\"web-to-app-routing\">Web-to-App 路由</a> 介绍从网页发起跳转的完整策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Android 深链实现","id":"android-深链实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Android Intent 与深链","id":"android-intent-与深链"},{"level":2,"text":"AndroidManifest.xml Intent Filter 声明","id":"androidmanifest-xml-intent-filter-声明"},{"level":2,"text":"Activity 中处理深链 Intent","id":"activity-中处理深链-intent"},{"level":2,"text":"Jetpack Navigation Component 深链","id":"jetpack-navigation-component-深链"},{"level":2,"text":"Jetpack Compose NavHost 深链","id":"jetpack-compose-navhost-深链"},{"level":2,"text":"任务栈（Back Stack）管理","id":"任务栈-back-stack-管理"},{"level":2,"text":"验证 App Links 的调试命令","id":"验证-app-links-的调试命令"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"iOS 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/ios-deep-linking-implementation"},"next":{"title":"Web-to-App 路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/web-to-app-routing"}}